        ## **1. What This Component Actually Does (Simple Terms)**
        **Gson** is a **Java-to-JSON translator**.
Think of it like a **language interpreter**:

Gson does two things:
Serialization: Convert Java objects → JSON text (save to file)
Deserialization: Convert JSON text → Java objects (load from file)

Gson benefits:
✅ Handles complex types (dates, nested objects)
✅ No manual parsing (error-prone)
✅ Standard JSON format (other tools can read it)
✅ Automatic type conversion
✅ Pretty-printing (human-readable)

